# The Docker build context is the codebox root (that is where the Dockerfile expects
# docker/entrypoint.sh to be). The image needs almost nothing from it, so keep the
# context small — and, more importantly, keep local secrets out of it entirely: the
# whole context is handed to the Docker daemon even when the Dockerfile never copies it.
.git
dist
vendor
*.pem
*.key
codebox*.env
!codebox.env.example
